WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.290
(bell dings)
- Okay, a stranger mistakes,

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.123
oh this has happened.

00:00:03.123 --> 00:00:05.430
A stranger mistakes
you for another person.

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.670
Do you, A, Roll with it,

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.250
pretending you are the
other person, (laughing)

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.880
or B, Embarrass the
stranger by correcting them?

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.020
What would you do, Cheryl?
- Ooh!

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:18.340
- Uh, I have rolled with it.
- I have as well.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:19.190
Yeah.

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:23.437
So I was on a plane, and
this person came up and said,

00:00:23.437 --> 00:00:26.240
"Oh my gosh, I love you."

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.790
And I said, "That's so nice, thank you."

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.010
And they said, " I love Modern Family."

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:33.220
And I said, " I do too!"
- (laughing) Oh my God!

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:37.280
And they said, "Can I get my
picture with you, Julie Bowen?"

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.992
And I was like, "Uh, yes."

00:00:39.992 --> 00:00:41.595
(laughing)

00:00:41.595 --> 00:00:42.770
- I did the same.
- Did you?!

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:45.630
- It was, and we don't,
y'all look similar,

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.420
I do not look like this person.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.567
This girl came up to me
and was like, "Oh my God."

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:53.460
"Your song "So Small"
is one of my favorites."

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:56.090
And I kept thinking, "I
don't have a song "So Small."

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:58.587
And then she said another
song, and I was like,

00:00:58.587 --> 00:01:00.350
"Oh, you think I'm Carrie Underwood."

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:04.150
And I was like, and I
literally look nothing

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:05.200
like Carrie Underwood.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.130
And I was like, and then I
was so embarrassed for her

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.320
that I just, she was
like, "Can you sign this?"

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.274
(laughing) And I totally
signed Carrie Underwood.

00:01:13.274 --> 00:01:14.822
(laughing)

00:01:14.822 --> 00:01:16.950
I think that might be illegal.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:18.690
- Just so you can get out of it.

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:21.440
I mean this one lady on
the airplane one time

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.250
thought I was Kim Coles,

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.610
and I didn't know how
to tell her otherwise,

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:26.530
'cause she was kind of old.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:28.500
So I'm like, "Maybe
this is her dying wish."

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.510
And so she just kept
asking me about TV stuff,

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:32.410
I was like, "Yep."

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:34.950
And at the end of the flight
I just gave her an autograph,

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:37.500
and I was like, "Have
fun, Ester." or Ethel,

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.760
whatever her name was.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.820
But sometimes you gotta go with it,

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:42.510
but I like putting people in their place,

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.670
'cause I am not Raven-Symone!

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:45.720
- Oh.
- What?!

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.040
Do people say that?

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.920
- That's not so Raven!

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:52.516
(laughing) Oh my God, that's awesome!

